## HistoryApi

### Account usage, cost, and volume statistics for a time window
## Account usage, cost, and volume statistics for a time window
GET https://api.mailbaby.net/mail/stats?time={{time}}
Accept: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}

### Query the mail delivery log (filterable, paginated)
## Query the mail delivery log (filterable, paginated)
GET https://api.mailbaby.net/mail/log?id={{id}}&origin={{origin}}&mx={{mx}}&from={{from}}&to={{to}}&subject={{subject}}&mailid={{mailid}}&messageId={{messageId}}&replyto={{replyto}}&headerfrom={{headerfrom}}&delivered={{delivered}}&skip={{skip}}&limit={{limit}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}&sort={{sort}}&dir={{dir}}&groupby={{groupby}}
Accept: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
